	measure '# Shared Opportunities' = ```
			CALCULATE (
			        SUMX (
			            SUMMARIZE (
			                'Opportunity',
			                'Opportunity'[Opportunity Number],
			                "Value",1
			            ),
			            [Value]
			        ),KEEPFILTERS('Partner Deal'[IsDealWith#PartnerGTM] = 1)
			        ,FILTER('Partner Deal','Partner Deal'[Referral Microsoft SubStatus(PartnerCenter)] = "Accepted" 
			        || 'Partner Deal'[Partner Acceptance SubStatus(PartnerCenter)] = "Accepted")
			    )
			```
		formatString: #,0
